# _headers: how long browsers and Cloudflare keep the shop's files (Cloudflare Pages, this file at the root of public/,
# which serves /squelette/, /scene/ and /insectes/ as outils/servir.py does locally).
# - pages, modules and styles: always checked again (a 304 most of the time), so a page never runs with the modules of
#   another publication (an old noyau.mjs under a new page leaves it empty);
# - data (boutique.json, sens.json...): five minutes, then checked again in the background for a day;
# - bouquets: a month, a collection's life; they are fixed once published (a redrawn bouquet needs a new sw.js VERSION
#   and waits for this month at worst in the browser's own cache: purge Cloudflare's cache when one is redrawn);
# - fonts and versioned libraries: a year, immutable (a new font or library gets a new name);
# - the service worker itself: always checked again (the browser looks for a new one at every visit anyway).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

/squelette/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/squelette/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/squelette/*.mjs
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/squelette/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/squelette/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/squelette/*.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/scene/*.mjs
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/scene/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/scene/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/scene/boutique.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/scene/bouquets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/scene/polices/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/insectes/runtime/*.mjs
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/insectes/runtime/vendor/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/insectes/*/atlas/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000, stale-while-revalidate=86400

# last, so they win over the rules above that match them too (rules add up; "!" takes off what an earlier one set)
/squelette/sw.js
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache
